
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>REVORA - Everyday Tasks Made Simple</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f7fb;color:#172033}
header{background:#101c35;color:white;padding:20px}
.logo{font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;color:#48e0ae}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:65px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#101c35,#174b68);color:white}
.hero h1{font-size:38px;margin:0 0 15px}
.hero p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}
.btn{background:#35d6a1;color:#102b32;padding:14px 25px;border:0;border-radius:9px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
section{padding:35px 20px;max-width:950px;margin:auto}
h2{text-align:center}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #0000000c}
.card h3{color:#147b68}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:#101c35;color:white}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<nav>
<div class="logo">REVORA</div>
<div>Everyday Tasks. Made Simple.</div>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
<h1>Welcome to REVORA</h1>
<p>সহজ কাজ শিখুন, দক্ষতা বাড়ান এবং নতুন সুযোগ তৈরি করুন।</p>
<button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('tasks').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Explore Tasks</button>
</div>

<section id="tasks">
<h2>Explore Opportunities</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h3>📚 Learn Skills</h3>
<p>নতুন নতুন দক্ষতা শিখুন সহজভাবে।</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>✅ Simple Tasks</h3>
<p>সহজ ও প্রয়োজনীয় কাজ সম্পন্ন করুন।</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🌍 Opportunities</h3>
<p>নিজের জন্য নতুন সুযোগ খুঁজে নিন।</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
<h3>REVORA</h3>
<p>Simple Tasks. Real Opportunities.</p>
<p>© 2026 REVORA</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
